WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
You can't live if you do it yourself

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,800
If I had known earlier, I would not have done this experiment.

3
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:07,760
Let Lulu rest tonight

4
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:08,760
I'll take care of her

5
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,100
You two didn't sleep well last night

6
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,000
Have a good rest today. I'll keep watch.

7
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:22,740
Fear of Chen Lei’s team position

8
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:23,940
Will definitely choose destruction

9
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:25,140
Already exposed today

10
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:26,540
They will never appreciate it

11
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:28,140
Staying here is the only way to die.

12
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:29,980
We must evacuate immediately tomorrow
